	)
	(text "NEON LAMPS – Brightmaster NEON-3 (strike ≤90 VDC, ~60 V settled). Each lead: 150k (200 V type) to HV+ and one half of an MMDT5551 (160 V) to GND. Pull one lead low: that electrode glows."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 177.8 0)
